# local env files. `.env` was tracked until 2026-08-02 — it only ever held the public API URL and
# a `_replace_me` placeholder (verified across its full history), but it is where SENTRY_DSN /
# SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN and real keys now land. `.env.example` stays tracked as the template.
.env
.env*.local

